# sweep: skip
# The live half of drive-source: every story is saved from its own site, then
# the brief survives a restart with its source and its time. Story sites can
# be slow or down for minutes, and a restart waits for that saving to finish,
# so this runs by hand rather than in the sweep.
wait-for Nothing yet
tap Source
wait-for All four are public Hacker News lists
tap-id source-show
wait-idle
tap Brief
wait-for Show Hacker News selected. Refresh to fetch it.
tap Refresh
wait-idle 60000
wait-for Show Hacker News · as of
expect Ready offline:
restart
wait-for Show Hacker News · as of
tap Source
wait-for All four are public Hacker News lists
clean
shot sources-after-restart
tap Brief
wait-for Daily brief
expect-missing as of 20
